OL,3,GNEWSAEljamel: Public evidence hearings
OL,4,Abegin into rogue surgeon
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquiry into disgraced brain
OL,7,Fsurgeon Sam Eljamel, who is believed to
OL,8,Fhave harmed hundreds of patients, has
OL,9,Fstarted to hear its first public
OL,10,Fevidence.
OL,12,FEljamel was a consultant neurosurgeon
OL,13,Fat Ninewells Hospital in Dundee from
OL,14,F1995 until his suspension in December
OL,15,F2013.
OL,17,FA public inquiry is taking place after
OL,18,Fpatients of Eljamel raised concerns
OL,19,Fthat he had caused harm to as many as
OL,20,F200 people.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
