OL,3,GNEWSAEljamel: Public evidence hearings
OL,4,Abegin into rogue surgeon
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first phase of hearings this week
OL,7,Finclude the broad trajectory of
OL,8,FEljamel's career, evidence relating to
OL,9,Fhim being placed under supervision in
OL,10,F2013, and NHS Tayside's document
OL,11,Fmanagement and retention systems.
